{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_21", "source_id": "669c6dda0000000025003da0", "title": "帮我养成妈生好皮的6组晚间护肤搭配（油皮）", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_669c6dda0000000025003da0", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 2315, "evidence_unit_count": 78, "original_evidence_unit_count": 78, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["我是油痘敏肌，29岁，其实大部分油皮姐妹都跟我一样，是在健康/油痘/油敏之间反复横跳，那下面这些套组是我亲测非常有效并且不会踩雷的，希望给大家一个参考", "兜底是最后做一个轻微的保湿、舒缓，因为用了酸容易脱皮", "+gycolic+hyaluronic +VITAMINC", "Acaderma Perfectly Natural", "200ml/6.7fl.oz.", "【健康油皮】 护肤重点：保持健康皮肤状态的同时去提升肤质、k老，这个时候会用一些让皮肤更加白皙、细腻、紧致、弹润、有光泽的护肤品，比如果酸、A醇、k老、白白产品", "这个晚上用完第二天起床我整个脸都在发光，一点都不夸张"], "retained_quotes": ["【健康油皮】 护肤重点：保持健康皮肤状态的同时去提升肤质、k老，这个时候会用一些让皮肤更加白皙、细腻、紧致、弹润、有光泽的护肤品，比如果酸、A醇、k老、白白产品", "这个晚上用完第二天起床我整个脸都在发光，一点都不夸张"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_669c6dda0000000025003da0/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_669c6dda0000000025003da0/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_669c6dda0000000025003da0/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_669c6dda0000000025003da0/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "0618090f51a36dacd2eb8ad992b1dabfe38afbccb02a3ac3cdf6176926e17adb", "card_hash": "e241e1f5c6ca0a8e1e98e16b0d02302ae38e0d4ea38e693a2ebd01ec3a3df439", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_21", "source_id": "669738be0000000025007f18", "title": "11年油痘肌！我终于知道油皮怎样有效K老了~", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_669738be0000000025007f18", "topic_family": "抗老与紧致", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1343, "evidence_unit_count": 41, "original_evidence_unit_count": 41, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 145, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["我们油皮真的太难了 当同病人都在K老了的时候 我们还在去动", "一边又担心说 哎呀我们一边斗斗怎么办 然后给你们的分享 不用这非常好", "这两成分 还可以从根本上红改善豆豆 因为它还用了十多种 太来平滑脸上的", "最后就是运动 就我以前是 剧讨厌运动 我是能做着 我就会站着", "坚持运动 这样才能够从内而外的 把一个好的状态给保持住", "也是毫无负担感 而且它让我的皮肤状态 一直处于那种油皮 和非常爱的理想的瓶状态", "然后除了护肤之外 调养也是K老很重要的一个部分 因为我的工作强度是比较大的"], "retained_quotes": ["也是毫无负担感 而且它让我的皮肤状态 一直处于那种油皮 和非常爱的理想的瓶状态", "然后除了护肤之外 调养也是K老很重要的一个部分 因为我的工作强度是比较大的"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_669738be0000000025007f18/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_669738be0000000025007f18/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_669738be0000000025007f18/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_669738be0000000025007f18/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "df1595f24b37cc75b007aa03a724e95f25ba7ce7cc4d8214dbef7861e1846160", "card_hash": "ae5d5bb86b9e18df06d590b5e260a9ba12304df4d47376cfc68f53bdab48cc98", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_21", "source_id": "6690fcbc00000000250051b3", "title": "一包搞定变美！跟随我多次旅行的mini彩妆", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6690fcbc00000000250051b3", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1211, "evidence_unit_count": 38, "original_evidence_unit_count": 38, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 149, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["如果这一代化妆品丢了 我会马上再去买一套印模一样的 因为它们就是又好用又迷你", "薄薄的一片有三种颜色 黑眼圈 体谅 抖印通通都能照不到 设计非常贴心", "很自然清透 出了油之后会有一种水光机 但是呢 持妆率又很好", "水蜜桃样的颜色 这个之前也给你们分享过 它就是不需要什么技术含量", "水光感 在阳光下面 会显得你的皮肤特别特别好", "如果这一代化妆品丢了 我会马上再去买一套印模一样的 因为它们就是又好用又迷你", "它就比硬币要大一点点 但是不要看它小 它里面还有镜子 再就是这个粉底液"], "retained_quotes": ["如果这一代化妆品丢了 我会马上再去买一套印模一样的 因为它们就是又好用又迷你", "它就比硬币要大一点点 但是不要看它小 它里面还有镜子 再就是这个粉底液"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6690fcbc00000000250051b3/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6690fcbc00000000250051b3/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6690fcbc00000000250051b3/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6690fcbc00000000250051b3/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "4ac06e15a459bd3b105ed5f52506f15ad633bbcd9d6d425fe1b9ccc530a601bf", "card_hash": "e7c9d2bb68e1dd8937f7bfcea22bbeb7897065e9f0554c89dfa2dc4f63c67574", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
